Package: monolith
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: save any web page as a single self-contained HTML file
 monolith downloads a web page and embeds every asset it references
 (CSS, images, fonts, scripts) into one HTML file that renders
 offline, using data: URIs. Options control scripting, media and
 metadata inclusion.
